"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"tool_rect_selection.png\" format=\"PNG\"/"
"> </imageobject> </inlinemediaobject> </guiicon> </link> <link linkend="
"\"tool-selections\">Selection (Rectangular)</link> (S)"
msgstr ""
"<link linkend=\"tool-selections\"> <guiicon> <inlinemediaobject> "
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"tool_rect_selection.png\" format=\"PNG\"/"
"> </imageobject> </inlinemediaobject> </guiicon> </link> <link linkend="
"\"tool-selections\">ការ​ជ្រើស (ចតុកោណ)</link> (S)"

#. Tag: member
#: index.docbook:350
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<link linkend=\"tool-spraycan\"> <guiicon> <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> "
"<imagedata fileref=\"tool_spraycan.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> </"
"inlinemediaobject> </guiicon> </link> <link linkend=\"tool-spraycan"
"\">Spraycan</link> (Y)"
msgstr ""
"<link linkend=\"tool-spraycan\"> <guiicon> <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> "
"<imagedata fileref=\"tool_spraycan.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> </"
"inlinemediaobject> </guiicon> </link> <link linkend=\"tool-spraycan"
"\">Spraycan</link> (Y)"

#. Tag: member
#: index.docbook:363
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<link linkend=\"tool-text\"> <guiicon> <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> "
"<imagedata fileref=\"tool_text.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> </"
"inlinemediaobject> </guiicon> </link> <link linkend=\"tool-text\">Text</"
"link> (T)"
msgstr ""
"<link linkend=\"tool-text\"> <guiicon> <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> "
"<imagedata fileref=\"tool_text.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> </"
"inlinemediaobject> </guiicon> </link> <link linkend=\"tool-text\">អត្ថបទ</"
"link> (T)"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:380
#, no-c-format
msgid "Brush"
msgstr "ជក់"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:388
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click or click and drag with the brush to draw."
msgstr "ចុច ឬ​ចុច និង​អូស​ជាមួយ​ជក់​ដើម្បី​គូរ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:405
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on one of the shapes to select the brush shape. You can use a "
"circular, square, slash or backslash brush shape."
msgstr ""
"ចុច​លើ​ស្រមោល​មួយ​ដើម្បី​ជ្រើស​ស្រមោល​ជក់ ។ អ្នក​អាច​ប្រើ​ស្រមោល​ជក់ \"/\" ឬ\"\"\" ការ៉េ ឬ​រង្វង់ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:414 index.docbook:467 index.docbook:602 index.docbook:654
#: index.docbook:792
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &LMB; draws in the foreground color. The &RMB; draws in the background "
"color."
msgstr "ប៊ូតុង​កណ្ដុរ​ឆ្វេង​គូរ​ជា​ពណ៌​ខាងមុខ ។ ប៊ូតុង​កណ្ដុរ​ស្ដាំ​គូរ​ពណ៌​ផ្ទៃ​ខាងក្រោយ ។"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:419
#, no-c-format
msgid "Color Picker"
msgstr "ឧបករណ៍​ជ្រើស​ពណ៌"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:426
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To set the foreground color, <mousebutton>left</mousebutton> click on a "
"pixel. To set the background color, <mousebutton>right</mousebutton> click "
"on a pixel. &kolourpaint; will then return to the previously selected tool."
msgstr ""
"ដើម្បី​កំណត់​ពណ៌​ខាងក្រោយ​ចុច <mousebutton>ឆ្វេង</mousebutton> នៅ​លើ​ភីកសែល ។ ដើម្បី​កំណត់​ពណ៌​ផ្ទៃ​"
"ខាងក្រោយ​ចុច <mousebutton>ស្ដាំ</mousebutton> នៅ​លើ​ភីកសែល ។ Kolourpaint នឹង​បន្ទាប់​ត្រឡប់​"
"ទៅ​​ឧបករណ៍​ដែល​បាន​ជ្រើស​មុន ។"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:433
#, no-c-format
msgid "Connected Lines and Polygon"
msgstr "បន្ទាត់ និង​ពហុកោណ​ដែល​តភ្ជាប់"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:441
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click and drag to draw connected lines. The polygon tool is used in the same "
"way, however, the start and end points are automatically connected to form a "
"polygon."
msgstr ""
"ចុច និង​អូស​ដើម្បី​គូរ​បន្ទាត់​ដែល​ភ្ជាប់ ។ ឧបករណ៍​ពហុកោណ​ត្រូវ​បាន​ប្រើ​តាម​វិធី​ដូចគ្នា ទោះ​យ៉ាង​ណា the start "
"and end points are automatically connected to form a polygon."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:445
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &LMB; draws in the foreground color. The &RMB; draws in the background "
"color, and will also reverse the fill color for polygons."
msgstr ""
"ប៊ូតុង​កណ្ដុរ​ឆ្វេង​គូរ​ពណ៌​ផ្ទៃ​ខាង​មុខ ។ ប៊ូតុង​កណ្ដុរ​ខាង​ស្ដាំ​គូរ​ផ្ទៃ​ខាង​ក្រោយ ហើយ​នឹង​បញ្ច្រាស​ពណ៌​ដែល​បំពេញ​សម្រាប់​"
"ពហុកោណ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:448
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can <link linkend=\"tool-options\">set the line width</link>. For "
"polygons, you can also <link linkend=\"tool-options\">set the fill style</"
"link>."
msgstr ""
"អ្នក​អាច <link linkend=\"tool-options\">កំណត់​ទទឹង​បន្ទាត់</link> ។ សម្រាប់​ពហុកោណ អ្នក​អាច "
"<link linkend=\"tool-options\">កំណត់​រចនាប័ទ្ម​បំពេញ</link> ។"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:455
#, no-c-format
msgid "Curve"
msgstr "ខ្សែកោង"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:462
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click and drag to draw a line - this sets the start and end points. You can "
"set up to two control points by dragging. To finish the curve without using "
"both or any control points, click the other mouse button. The curve tool "
"draws a Cubic Bezier."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:470 index.docbook:605
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can also <link linkend=\"tool-options\">set the line width</link>."
msgstr "អ្នក​អាច <link linkend=\"tool-options\">កំណត់​ទទឹង​បន្ទាត់</link> ។"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:476
#, no-c-format
msgid "Ellipse"
msgstr "ពង​ក្រពើ"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:483
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click and drag to draw an ellipse."
msgstr "ចុច និង​អូស​ដើម្បី​គូរ​រាង​ពង​ក្រពើ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:485 index.docbook:671
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &LMB; draws in the foreground color. The &RMB; draws in the background "
"color, and will reverse the fill color."
msgstr "ប៊ូតុង​កណ្ដុរ​ឆ្វេង​គូរ​ពណ៌​ផ្ទៃ​ខាង​មុខ ។ ប៊ូតុង​កណ្ដុរ​ស្ដាំ​គូរ​ពណ៌​ផ្ទៃ​ខាងក្រោយ ហើយ​នឹង​បញ្ច្រាស​ពណ៌​បំពេញ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:488 index.docbook:674
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can also <link linkend=\"tool-options\">set the line width and fill "
"style</link>."
msgstr ""
"អ្នក​អាច <link linkend=\"tool-options\">កំណត់​ទទឹង​បន្ទាត់ និង​រចនាប័ទ​បំពេញ</link> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:491 index.docbook:677
#, no-c-format
msgid "For additional functionality, use the modifier keys:"
msgstr "សម្រាប់​មុខងារ​បន្ថែម ប្រើ​គ្រាប់ចុច​កែប្រែ ៖"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:495
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hold &Shift; and drag to draw a circle."
msgstr "សង្កត់(Shift) និង​អូស​ដើម្បី​គូរ​រង្វង់ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:498
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To draw an ellipse with a center point of your choice, hold &Ctrl;, click on "
"the center point, and drag until the ellipse is the correct size and shape."
msgstr ""
"ដើម្បី​គូរ​ពង​ក្រពើ​ដែល​មាន​ចំណុច​កណ្ដាល​នៃ​ជម្រើស​របស់​អ្នក សង្កត់ បញ្ជា ចុច​លើ​ចំណុច​កណ្ដាល និង​អូស​ទាល់តែ​ពង​"
"ក្រពើ​មាន​ទំហំ និង​រូបរាង​ត្រឹមត្រូវ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:503
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To draw a circle with a center point of your choice, hold &Ctrl; and "
"&Shift;, click on the center point, and drag until the circle is the correct "
"size."
msgstr ""
"ដើម្បី​គូរ​រង្វង់​ដែល​មាន​ចំណុច​កណ្ដាល​នៃ​ជម្រើស​របស់​អ្នក សង្កត់ បញ្ជា និង​ប្ដូរ ចុច​លើ​ចំណុច​កណ្ដាល និង​អូស​ទាល់តែ​"
"រង្វង់​មាន​ទំហំ​ត្រឹមត្រូវ ។"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:513
#, no-c-format
msgid "Erasers"
msgstr "ជ័រ​លុប"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:516
#, no-c-format
msgid "Eraser"
msgstr "ជ័រ​លុប"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:524
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click and drag with the eraser to rub out mistakes."
msgstr "ចុច និង​អូស​ជាមួយ​ជ័រ​លុប​ដើម្បី​លុប​កំហុស ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:527
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Unlike other tools, the erasers draw in the background color. To draw in the "
"foreground color, use the &RMB;."
msgstr "មិន​ដូច​ឧបករណ៍​ផ្សេង ជ័រ​លុប​គូរ​ពណ៌​ផ្ទៃ​ខាង​ក្រោយ ។ ដើម្បី​គូរ​ពណ៌​ផ្ទៃ​ខាងមុខ​ប្រើ​ប៊ូតុង​កណ្ដុរ​ស្ដាំ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:531
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The eraser only has <link linkend=\"tool-options\">square shapes</link>. To "
"draw with other shapes such as circles use the <link linkend=\"tool-brush"
"\">Brush</link> and the &RMB;."
msgstr ""
"ជ័រ​លុប​មាន​តែ <link linkend=\"tool-options\">រាង​បួន​ជ្រុង</link> ។ ដើម្បី​គូរ​ជាមួយ​រាង​ផ្សេង​"
"ទៀត​ដូចជា​រង្វង់​ប្រើ <link linkend=\"tool-brush\">ជក់</link> និត​ប៊ូតុង​កណ្ដុរ​ស្ដាំ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:536
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Double-click on the Eraser icon to clear the entire image. This is "
"equivalent to using the <link linkend=\"image-clear\">Clear</link> option on "
"the Image menu."
msgstr ""
"ចុច​ទ្វេ​ដង​លើ​រូប​តំណាង​ជ័រ​លុប​ដើម្បី​ជម្រះ​រូបភាព​ទាំងមូល ។ នេះ​ដូច​គ្នា​នឹង​ការ​ប្រើ​ជម្រើស <link linkend="
"\"image-clear\">ជម្រះ</link> នៅ​លើ​ម៉ឺនុយ​រូបភាព ។"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:544
#, no-c-format
msgid "Color Eraser"
msgstr "ជ័រ​លុប​ពណ៌"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:552
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click and drag to replace pixels of the foreground color with the background "
"color. To replace all pixels similar (but not necessarily exactly equal) to "
"the foreground color, such as in dithered images and photos, use a <link "
"linkend=\"color-box\">Color Similarity</link> setting other than Exact."
msgstr ""
"ចុច និង​អូស​ដើម្បី​ជំនួស​ភីកសែល​នៃ​ពណ៌​ខាង​មុខ​ដែល​មាន​ពណ៌​ផ្ទៃ​ខាងក្រោយ ។ ដើម្បី​ជំនួស​ភីកសែល​ស្រដៀង​គ្នា (ប៉ុន្តែ​មិន​"
"ចាំបាច់​ដូច​គ្នា​បេះបិទ​ទេ) ចំពោះ​ពណ៌​ផ្ទៃ​ខាង​មុខ ដូច​ជា​ក្នុង​រូបភាព និង​ច្របូកច្របល់ ប្រើ​ការ​កំណត់ <link "
"linkend=\"color-box\">ភាព​ស្រដៀង​ពណ៌​គ្នា</link> ជា​ជាង​ពិត​ប្រាកដ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:559
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Unlike other tools, the erasers draw in the background color. To replace "
"pixels of the background color with the foreground color, use the &RMB;."
msgstr ""
"មិន​ដូច​ឧបករណ៍​ផ្សេង ជ័រ​លុប​គូស​ពណ៌​ផ្ទៃ​ខាងក្រោយ ។ ដើម្បី​ជំនួស​ភីកសែល​នៃ​ពណ៌​ផ្ទៃ​ខាងក្រោយ​ជាមួយ​ពណ៌​ផ្ទៃ​ខាង​មុខ "
"ប្រើ​ប៊ូតុង​កណ្ដុរ​ស្ដាំ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:564
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can configure the <link linkend=\"tool-options\">eraser size</link>."
msgstr "អ្នក​អាច​កំណត់​រចនា​សម្ព័ន្ធ <link linkend=\"tool-options\">ទំហំ​ជ័រ​លុប</link> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:568
#, no-c-format
msgid "Double-click on the Color Eraser icon to apply it to the entire image."
msgstr "ចុច​ទ្វេរ​ដង​លើ​រូប​តំណាង​ជ័រ​លុប​ពណ៌​ដើម្បី​អនុវត្ត​វា​ទៅ​រូបភាព​ទាំងមូល ។"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:575
#, no-c-format
msgid "Flood Fill"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:583
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click to fill a region. To fill a dithered region, use a <link linkend="
"\"color-box\">Color Similarity</link> setting other than Exact."
msgstr ""
"ចុច​ដើម្បី​បំពេញ​តំបន់ ។ ដើម្បី​បំពេញ​តំបន់​ច្របូក​ច្របល់ ប្រើ​ការ​កំណត់ <link linkend=\"color-box\">ភាព​"
"ស្រដៀង​គ្នា​នៃ​ពណ៌</link> ជា​ជាង​ពិត ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:586
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &LMB; fills in the foreground color. The &RMB; fills in the background "
"color."
msgstr "ប៊ូតុង​កណ្ដុរ​ឆ្វេង​បំពេញ​ពណ៌​ផ្ទៃ​ខាង​មុខ ។ ប៊ូតុង​កណ្ដុរ​ខាង​ស្ដាំ​បំពេញ​ពណ៌​ផ្ទៃ​ខាងក្រោយ ។"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:591
#, no-c-format
msgid "Line"
msgstr "បន្ទាត់"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:600
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click and drag to draw a line."
msgstr "ចុច និង​អូស​ដើម្បី​គូរ​បន្ទាត់ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:628
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Hold &Ctrl; to draw lines angled at the nearest multiple of 30 degrees - "
"these are the lines in the red diagram."
msgstr ""
"សង្កត់​បញ្ជា​ដើម្បី​គូរ​បន្ទាត់​កោង​នៅ​ក្បែរ​ពហុគុណ​នៃ ៣០ ដឺក្រេ ទាំង​នេះ​គឺ​ជា​បន្ទាត់​ក្នុង​ដ្យាក្រាម​ក្រហម ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:632
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Hold &Shift; to draw lines angled at the nearest multiple of 45 degrees - "
"these are the lines in the blue diagram."
msgstr ""
"សង្កត់​ជំនួស​ដើម្បី​គូរ​បន្ទាត់​កោង​នៅ​ក្បែរ​ពហុគុណ​នៃ ៤៥ ដឺក្រេ ទាំងនេះ​គឺ​ជា​បន្ទាត់​នៅ​ក្នុង​ដ្យាក្រាម​ខៀវ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:636
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Hold &Ctrl; and &Shift; to draw lines angled at the nearest multiple of 30 "
"or 45 degrees - these are the lines in the green diagram."
msgstr ""
"សង្កត់​បញ្ជា និង​ជំនួស​ដើម្បី​គូរ​បន្ទាត់​កោង​នៅ​ក្បែរ​ពហុគុណ​នៃ ៣០ ឬ ៤៥ ដឺក្រេ ទាំងនេះ​គឺ​ជា​បន្ទាត់​ក្នុង​"
"ដ្យាក្រាម​បៃតង ។"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:644
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Pen</title>"
msgstr "<title>ប៊ិច</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:652
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click to draw a dot or click and drag to draw a freehand line."
msgstr "ចុច​ដើម្បី​គូរ​ចំណុច ឬ​ចុច និង​អូស​ដើម្បី​គូរ​បន្ទាត់​សេរី ។"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:660
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rectangles"
msgstr "ចតុកោណ"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:668
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click and drag to draw a rectangle. The Rounded Rectangle is a Rectangle "
"with rounded corners."
msgstr "ចុច និង​អូស​ដើម្បី​គូរ​ចតុកោណ ។ ចតុកោណ​មូល​គឺ​ជា​ចតុកោណ​ជាមួយ​និង​ជ្រុង​មូល ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:681
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hold &Shift; and drag to draw a square."
msgstr "សង្កត់​ជំនួស និង​អូស​ដើម្បី​គូរ​ការ៉េ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:684
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To draw a rectangle with a center point of your choice, hold &Ctrl;, click "
"on the center point, and drag until the rectangle is the correct size and "
"shape."
msgstr ""
"ដើម្បី​គូរ​ចតុកោណ​ដែល​មាន​ចំណុច​កណ្ដាល​នៃ​ជម្រើស​របស់​អ្នក សង្កត់​បញ្ជា ចុច​លើ​ចំណុច​កណ្ដាល និង​អូស​ទាល់តែ​ចតុកោណ​"
"មាន​រូបរាង និង​ស្រមោល​ត្រឹមត្រូវ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:689
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To draw a square with a center point of your choice, hold &Ctrl; and "
"&Shift;, click on the center point, and drag until the square is the correct "
"size."
msgstr ""
"ដើម្បី​គូរ​ការ៉េ​ដែល​មាន​ចំណុច​កណ្ដាល​នៃ​ជម្រើស​របស់​អ្នក សង្កត់​បញ្ជា និង​ជំនួស ចុច​លើ​ចំណុច​កណ្ដាល និង​អូស​ទាល់​តែ​"
"ការ៉េ​មាន​ទំហំ​ត្រឹមត្រូវ ។"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:697
#, no-c-format
msgid "Selections"
msgstr "ការ​ជ្រើស"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:705
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use the selection tools to draw out the boundary of a selection."
msgstr "ប្រើ​ឧបករណ៍​ជ្រើស​ដើម្បី​គូរ​ស៊ុម​នៃ​ការ​ជ្រើស ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:708
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To move the selection, click and drag on it. The main view will scroll as "
"required to allow you to move the selection to part of the image that is not "
"currently displayed."
msgstr ""
"ដើម្បី​ផ្លាស់ទី​ការ​ជ្រើស ចុច និង​អុស​លើ​វា ។ ទិដ្ឋភាព​មេ​នឹង​រមូរ​ដូច​ដែល​បាន​ទាមទារ​ដើម្បី​អនុញ្ញាត​ឲ្យ​អ្នក​"
"ផ្លាស់ទី​ការ​ជ្រើស​ទៅ​ផ្នែក​នៃ​រូបភាព ដែល​មិន​ត្រូវ​បាន​បង្ហាញ​បច្ចុប្បន្ន ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:710
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can free-form <link linkend=\"image-resize-scale\">Resize</link> the "
"entire image or <link linkend=\"image-resize-scale\">Smooth Scale</link> the "
"selection using the corresponding handles. Hold &Shift; while free-form "
"scaling the selection to maintain aspect ratio. The &RMB; invokes a context "
"menu with common <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> commands and <link linkend=\"image-"
"effects-section\">Image Effects</link>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:718
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can use the cursor keys while drawing out the boundary of the selection "
"or while moving it."
msgstr "អ្នក​អាច​ប្រើ​គ្រាប់​ចុច​ទស្សន៍​ទ្រនិច ខណៈ​ពេល​គូរ​ស៊ុម​នៃ​ការ​ជ្រើស ឬ​ខណៈ​ពេល​ផ្លាស់ទី​វា ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:722
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you hold &Ctrl; before moving the selection, then you will move a copy of "
"it. The selection will be smeared when moving it while &Shift; is held."
msgstr ""
"បើ​អ្នក​សង្កត់​បញ្ជា​មុន​ពេល​ផ្លាស់ទី​ការ​ជ្រើស បន្ទាប់​អ្នក​នឹង​ផ្លាស់ទី​ច្បាប់​ចម្លង​របស់​វា ។ ការ​ជ្រើស​នឹង​ត្រូវ​បាន​"
"ធ្វើ​ឲ្យ​ប្រឡាក់ ពេល​ផ្លាស់ទី​វា ខណៈ​ពេល​សង្កត់​ប្ដូរ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:740
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are two selection modes: Opaque (default) and Transparent. If you use "
"the Transparent selection mode, all pixels of the background color will be "
"transparent (background subtraction). This allows you to paste a selection "
"without the background. To perform background subtraction on a dithered "
"image, use a <link linkend=\"color-box\">Color Similarity</link> setting "
"other than Exact."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:752
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can apply Image Effects to a selection - see the <link linkend=\"image-"
"effects-section\">Image Effects</link> section for more information."
msgstr ""
"អ្នក​អាច​អនុវត្ត​បែបផែន​រូបភាព​សម្រាប់​ការ​ជ្រើស - សូម​មើល​ផ្នែក <link linkend=\"image-effects-"
"section\">បែប​ផែន​រូបភាព</link> សម្រាប់​ព័ត៌មាន​បន្ថែម ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:756
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is possible to save selection to file using the <guimenuitem>Copy to "
"File...</guimenuitem> item from the selection context menu or "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guimenuitem>Copy to File...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> item from the main menu."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:761
#, no-c-format
msgid "Spraycan"
msgstr "Spraycan"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:769
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click and drag to spray graffiti. Hold down the mouse button for a more "
"concentrated spray."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:784
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on one of the shapes to select the spray size. You can select from "
"spray sizes of 9x9, 17x17 and 29x29."
msgstr "ចុច​លើ​រូបរាង​មួយ​ដើម្បី​ជ្រើស​ទំហំ​បាញ ។ អ្នក​អាច​ជ្រើស​ទំហំ​បាញ់​នៃ 9x9, 17x17 និង 29x29 ។"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:798
#, no-c-format
msgid "Text"
msgstr "អត្ថបទ"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:806
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Click and drag an area in which to write text. Click and drag on the "
#| "border to move it. You can resize the text box by dragging on the handles "
#| "or by using the <link linkend=\"image-resize-scale\">Resize</link> dialog."
msgid ""
"Click and drag an area in which to write text. As soon as the border will be "
"shown you can start writing the text. Click and drag on the border to move "
"it. You can resize the text box by dragging on the handles or by using the "
"<link linkend=\"image-resize-scale\">Resize</link> dialog."
msgstr ""
"ចុច និង​អូស​ផ្ទៃ​ដើម្បី​សរសេរ​អត្ថបទ ។ ចុច និង​អូស​លើ​ស៊ុម​ដើម្បី​ផ្លាស់ទី​វា ។ អ្នក​អាច​ប្ដូរ​ទំហំ​ប្រអប់​អត្ថបទ​ដោយ​អូស​"
"លើ​ចំណុច​ទាញ ឬ​ដោយ​ប្រើ​ប្រអប់<link linkend=\"image-resize-scale\">ប្ដូរ​ទំហំ</link> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:813
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have deselected a text box you can use <guimenuitem>Undo</"
"guimenuitem> to edit the text again."
msgstr ""
"បើ​អ្នក​បាន​ដោះ​ជ្រើស​ប្រអប់​អត្ថបទ អ្នក​អាច​ប្រើ <guimenuitem>មិន​ធ្វើ</guimenuitem> ដើម្បី​កែ​"
"សម្រួល​អត្ថបទ​ម្ដង​ទៀត ។"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:818
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using the Transparent Color"
msgstr "ដោយ​ប្រើ"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:827
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The left picture shows the example image. The right picture shows the "
"addition of text with opaque foreground and background colors."
msgstr ""
"រូបភាព​ខាង​ឆ្វេង​បង្ហាញ​រូបភាព​ឧទាហរណ៍ ។ រូបភាព​ខាង​ស្ដាំ​បង្ហាញ​ការ​បន្ថែម​នៃ​អត្ថបទ​ដែល​មាន​ពណ៌​ខាងមុខ "
"និង​ខាងក្រោម​ស្រអាប់ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:839
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The left picture shows the addition of text with opaque foreground colors "
"and a transparent background color. The right picture shows the addition of "
"text with a transparent foreground color and opaque background color."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:847
#, no-c-format
msgid "Common Tool Options"
msgstr "ជម្រើស​ឧបករណ៍​ទូទៅ"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:861
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on one of the squares to select the eraser size. You can select from "
"squares of side length 2, 3, 5, 9, 17 and 29 pixels."
msgstr ""
"ចុច​លើ​ការ៉េ​មួយ​ដើម្បី​ជ្រើស​ទំហំ​ជ័រ​លុប ។ អ្នក​អាច​ជ្រើស​ពី​ការ៉េ​ដែល​មាន​ជ្រុង​ប្រវែង ២ ៣ ៥ ៩ ១៧ និង ២៩ "
"ភីកសែល ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:864
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The eraser size setting affects the <link linkend=\"tool-erasers\">Erasers</"
"link>."
msgstr "ការ​កំណត់​ទំហំ​ជ័រ​លុប​ប៉ះពាល់ <link linkend=\"tool-erasers\">ជ័រ​លុប</link> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:877
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on one of the lines to select the line width. You can select from line "
"widths of 1, 2, 3, 5 and 8 pixel(s)."
msgstr ""
"ចុច​លើ​បន្ទាត់​មួយ​ដើម្បី​ជ្រើស​ទទឹង​បន្ទាត់ ។ អ្នក​អាច​ជ្រើស​ពី​ទទឹង​បន្ទាត់​ដែល​មាន​ជ្រុង ១ ២ ៣ ៥ និង ៨ "
"ភីកសែល ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:880
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The line width setting affects the <link linkend=\"tool-polystar\">Connected "
"Lines</link>, <link linkend=\"tool-curve\">Curve</link>, <link linkend="
"\"tool-ellipse\">Ellipse</link>, <link linkend=\"tool-line\">Line</link>, "
"<link linkend=\"tool-polystar\">Polygon</link>, <link linkend=\"tool-"
"rectangles\">Rectangle</link> and <link linkend=\"tool-rectangles\">Rounded "
"Rectangle</link> tools."
msgstr ""
"ការ​កំណត់​ទទឹង​បន្ទាត់​ប៉ះពាល់​ឧបករណ៍ <link linkend=\"tool-polystar\">បន្ទាត់​ដែល​តភ្ជាប់</"
"link> <link linkend=\"tool-curve\">ខ្សែ​កោង</link> <link linkend=\"tool-ellipse"
"\">ពង​ក្រពើ</link> <link linkend=\"tool-line\">បន្ទាត់</link> <link linkend="
"\"tool-polystar\">ពហុកោណ</link> <link linkend=\"tool-rectangles\">ចតុកោណ</"
"link> និង <link linkend=\"tool-rectangles\">ចតុកោណ​មូល</link> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:899
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on one of the rectangles to select the fill style. You can select from "
"No Fill, Fill with Background Color and Fill with Foreground Color."
msgstr ""
"ចុច​លើ​ចតុកោណ​មួយ​ដើម្បី​ជ្រើស​រចនាប័ទ្ម​បំពេញ ។ អ្នក​ជ្រើស​ពី មិន​បំពេញ បំពេញ​ពណ៌​ផ្ទៃ​ខាងក្រោយ និង​បំពេញ​ពណ៌​ផ្ទៃ​"
"ខាង​មុខ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:901
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The fill style setting affects the <link linkend=\"tool-ellipse\">Ellipse</"
"link>, <link linkend=\"tool-polystar\">Polygon</link>, <link linkend=\"tool-"
"rectangles\">Rectangle</link> and <link linkend=\"tool-rectangles\">Rounded "
"Rectangle</link> tools."
msgstr ""
"ការ​កំណត់​រចនាប័ទ្ម​បំពេញ​ប៉ះពាល់​ឧបករណ៍ <link linkend=\"tool-ellipse\">ពង​ក្រពើ</link> "
"<link linkend=\"tool-polystar\">ពហុកោណ</link> <link linkend=\"tool-rectangles"
"\">ចតុកោណ</link> និង <link linkend=\"tool-rectangles\">ចតុកោណ​មូល</link> ។"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:917
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Working with Color</title>"
msgstr "<title>ធ្វើការ​ជាមួយ​ពណ៌</title>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:920
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Color Box"
msgstr "ប្រអប់​ពណ៌"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:928
#, no-c-format
msgid "Color Box"
msgstr "ប្រអប់​ពណ៌"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:933
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Color Box has 3 main sections: the Color Tablet, the Color Palette and "
"the Color Similarity Selector."
msgstr "ប្រអប់​ពណ៌​មាន​ផ្នែក​បី​សំខាន់ ៖ តារាង​ពណ៌ ក្ដារ​លាយ​ពណ៌ និង​ឧបករណ៍​ជ្រើស​ភាព​ស្រដៀង​ពណ៌ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:936
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Color Tablet shows the current foreground color as a square on top of "
"another square representing the current background color. When drawing with "
"the &LMB;, the foreground color is used, and when drawing with the &RMB; the "
"background color is used (except for the <link linkend=\"tool-erasers"
"\">Erasers</link>). You can click on the double-ended arrow to swap the "
"foreground and background colors."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:943
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Color Palette shows a selection of colors for you to choose from. The "
"translucent pyramid represents the transparent color. Left-click on a color "
"to set the foreground color and right-click on a color to set the background "
"color. You can also drag and drop any opaque color into the Color Tablet "
"squares. To edit a color in the Color Tablet or Palette, double-click on it. "
"The <link linkend=\"tool-color-picker\">Color Picker</link> tool allows you "
"to select a color from the image."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:951
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Color Similarity allows you to work more effectively with dithered images "
"and photos, in a comparable manner to the <quote>Magic Wand</quote> feature "
"of other paint programs. It applies to transparent selections, as well as "
"the <link linkend=\"tool-flood-fill\">Flood Fill</link>, <link linkend="
"\"tool-eraser-clr\">Color Eraser</link> and <link linkend=\"image-autocrop"
"\">Autocrop / Remove Internal Border</link> tools. Double-click on the Color "
"Similarity Selector to choose how similar colors must be to be considered "
"identical. When using selections in Transparent mode, any color in the "
"selection that is similar to the background color will also be made "
"transparent."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:969
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The left picture shows the example image. The right pictures demonstrate the "
"use of a flood fill, with Color Similarity settings of 5%, 15% and 30%. In "
"this example, with a Color Similarity setting of <guilabel>Exact</guilabel>, "
"a flood fill at (80, 100) would only fill one pixel, as the surrounding "
"pixels are similar but not identical. As Color Similarity is increased, more "
"pixels that are similar in color are considered identical, hence the fill "
"extends further."
msgstr ""

